<</AP<</N 182 0 R >>/DA(/Helv 10 Tf 0 g)/F 4/FT/Tx/Ff 4096/MK<<>>/P 3 0 R /Rect[ 109.947 246.153 536.595 434.697]/Subtype/Widget/T(q1)/Type/Annot/V(The reason why a network administrator would use Wireshark and NetWitness Investigator together is due to: 1\) Wireshark being able to capture packets of data in large amounts, see into any amounts of traffic that happens within a network, as well as any information being swapped between systems, 2\) NetWitness Investigator can help organize this vast amount of information found by Wireshark and make it more digestable for the network administrator, making it easier to analyze and interpret any possible anomalies that happen on the network.)>>
